      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她站在顶楼放声大笑。\n校园里的赛马娘，只能目瞪口呆地抬头看她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6970a3cf8ee5f8d9f6c554e25421da99d790090ada17f17d3afa8146f5877de3",
