      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "必须立刻通知本人才行。\n虽然现在是一般的赛马娘\n会待在训练赛道的时段……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f8d85cc66a50fbfd1302fc6ef78ebaac269a7f2cd7166f6d29690d9ce3f233",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
