      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要让好歌剧成为最强的“世纪末霸王”。\n为此，与前一个世代的对决无可避免。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b92386924dd9b1f4ba5f72870f2f36f8ba0f75f56dc9c87f907a214e7f7d2d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
